WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.777
Wow!

2
00:00:02.778 --> 00:00:05.367
Who

3
00:00:05.368 --> 00:00:10.348
are you? I'm

4
00:00:10.349 --> 00:00:13.850
a manatee. We

5
00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:18.065
are big mammals. You

6
00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:21.651
live in the sea, right? Manatees

7
00:00:21.652 --> 00:00:26.886
live in oceans and rivers. We

8
00:00:26.887 --> 00:00:30.145
like warm water. So

9
00:00:30.146 --> 00:00:34.455
we move to stay warm. What

10
00:00:34.456 --> 00:00:37.047
do you eat? We

11
00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:40.801
eat lots of plants. Sometimes

12
00:00:40.802 --> 00:00:46.619
we eat tiny fish by mistake. Are

13
00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.359
you a sea cow? Yes.

14
00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:53.773
Some people call us sea cows. But

15
00:00:53.774 --> 00:00:56.872
we're more like elephants. We

16
00:00:56.873 --> 00:01:01.609
both have thick skin and toenails.

17
00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:05.316
Do you ever go on land?

18
00:01:05.317 --> 00:01:08.474
No. Manatees stay in the water.

19
00:01:08.475 --> 00:01:15.592
But we come up often for air.

20
00:01:15.593 --> 00:01:18.867
How do you swim?

21
00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:23.401
We use our strong tails to move.

22
00:01:23.402 --> 00:01:34.976
We steer with our flippers.

23
00:01:34.977 --> 00:01:38.912
Do you have any enemies?

24
00:01:38.913 --> 00:01:42.616
We are gentle and friendly.

25
00:01:42.617 --> 00:01:47.229
But sometimes people hunt us.

26
00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:51.806
They also pollute our oceans and rivers.

27
00:01:51.807 --> 00:01:54.906
It's time for another swim.

28
00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:57.795
Good-bye!

29
00:01:57.796 --> 00:02:03.959
So long, Manatee!

